 Kollmann","content":"","created_at":"2026-09-09T20:02:45Z","headline":"QUICK SPARK: Michael Burry Sells All Nvidia, Palantir December 2026-Dated Puts","id":61700205,"images":[{"size":"large","url":"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/09/Benzinga-Quick-Spark.jpg?width=2048\u0026height=1536"},{"size":"small","url":"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/09/Benzinga-Quick-Spark.jpg?width=1024\u0026height=768"},{"size":"thumb","url":"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/09/Benzinga-Quick-Spark.jpg?width=250\u0026height=187"}],"source":"benzinga","summary":"Michael Burry exited his Nvidia and PLTR stock December 2026 puts, while trimming most other positions in an effort to reduce risk.","symbols":["NBIS","NVDA","PLTR","QQQ"],"updated_at":"2026-09-09T20:02:45Z","url":"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/options/26/09/61700205/quick-spark-michael-burry-sells-all-nvidia-palantir-december-2026-dated-puts"},{"author":"Chris Katje","content":"","created_at":"2026-09-09T19:41:46Z","headline":"South Park Vs. Trump (And Google \u0026 Apple): Hit Animated Show Switches Name in Nod to President’s Map Changes","id":61699567,"images":[{"size":"large","url":"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/09/South-Park.jpg?width=2048\u0026height=1536"},{"size":"small","url":"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/09/South-Park.jpg?width=1024\u0026height=768"},{"size":"thumb","url":"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/09/South-Park.jpg?width=250\u0026height=187"}],"source":"benzinga","summary":"Animated show \u0026#34;South Park\u0026#34; is poking fun at President Donald Trump\u0026#39;s love of geographic name changes with its newest season.","symbols":["AAPL","GOOG","GOOGL","PSKY","SST"],"updated_at":"2026-09-09T19:41:46Z","url":"https://www.benzinga.com/news/entertainment/26/09/61699567/south-park-vs-trump-and-google-apple-hit-animated-show-switches-name-in-nod-to-presidents-map-changes"},{"author":"Piero C