 Max","id":61694800,"images":[],"source":"benzinga","summary":"","symbols":["AAPL"],"updated_at":"2026-09-09T17:09:21Z","url":"https://www.benzinga.com/news/26/09/61694800/apple-announces-iphone-18-pro-and-iphone-18-pro-max"},{"author":"Piero Cingari","content":"","created_at":"2026-09-09T17:04:58Z","headline":"Oil Tops $100, Meta and Cloudflare Jump On AI Breakthroughs: Stock Market Today","id":61694601,"images":[{"size":"large","url":"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/09/Markets-up.jpg?width=2048\u0026height=1536"},{"size":"small","url":"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/09/Markets-up.jpg?width=1024\u0026height=768"},{"size":"thumb","url":"https://cdn.benzinga.com/files/images/story/2026/09/09/Markets-up.jpg?width=250\u0026height=187"}],"source":"benzinga","summary":"Brent crude pushes above $100 a barrel for the first time since July as US-Iran strikes escalated, equities slip broadly.","symbols":["AKAM","ALAB","CASY","CHWY","DDOG","DIA","IWM","META","MU","NET","QQQ","SKHY","SUNB","UI","VOO","VRT","XE","XLE","XLF","XLI","XLK","XLP","XLRE","XLU","XLV","XLY","ZS"],"updated_at":"2026-09-09T17:04:58Z","url":"https://www.benzinga.com/markets/equities/26/09/61694601/oil-tops-100-meta-cloudflare-jump-ai-breakthroughs-markets-wednesday"},{"author":"Benzinga News-desk","content":"","created_at":"2026-09-09T17:02:56Z","headline":"LIVE: Apple Event Begins; New Product Announcements, Prices, Release Dates And The Company's First Launch Under CEO John Ternus","id":61694545,"images":[],"source":"benzinga","summary":"","symbols":["AAPL"],"updated_at":"2026-09-09T17:04:37Z","url":"https://www.benzinga.com/news/26/09/61694545/live-apple-event-begins-new-product-announcements-prices-release-dates-and-the-companys-first-launch-under-ceo-john-ternus"},{"author":"Chandrima Sanyal","content":"","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:35:28Z","headline":"Forget 5X ETFs. Nvidia, Tesla, SpaceX and Palantir Could Soon Get Hourly 2X Bets","id":61693689,"images":[{"s